        <source>From 0.0 (bot) to 1.0 (human). 0.5 is a good start.</source>
        <target>De 0.0 (bot) a 1.0 (humano). 0.5 es un buen punto de partida.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="660dceef85b35a0e8897f0a10d5fc519">
        <source>Google reCAPTCHA Enterprise</source>
        <target>Google reCAPTCHA Enterprise</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="5119a3b94c1c89b3021ddf6d9c10418e">
        <source>Use a site key from Google Cloud Console and an API key allowed to call the reCAPTCHA Enterprise API.</source>
        <target>Use una clave de sitio de Google Cloud Console y una clave de API con permiso para llamar a la API de reCAPTCHA Enterprise.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="567211f78e286e00c938772c5a27a6c4">
